the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense"}," score of an opponent. The Gamemaster must know the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Checks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Checks"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Defense"}," scores of the relevant opponents to determine Successes and Failures.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["For example, you can use this effect for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenges"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenges","referenceId":"reference:f25acdf2810584ed"}," in which the heroes try to outmaneuver an enemy Antislicer Droid, or when they engage in a battle of wits with an enemy commander.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Use the Opposed DC Challenge Effect when:"]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Challenge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Challenge"}," has a specific opponent or set of opponents."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["The heroes are taking actions directly against an individual."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":["You don't want to base the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," DCs on the situation."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
